"Each medium is controlled by device (i.e., disk drive, tape drive)": "প্রতিটি মাধ্যম একটি ডিভাইস নিয়ন্ত্রণ করে (যেমন disk drive, tape drive)",
"Varying properties include access speed, capacity, data-transfer rate, access method (sequential or random)": "ভিন্ন ভিন্ন বৈশিষ্ট্য: access speed, capacity, data-transfer rate, access method (sequential বা random)",
